  "description": "Adds a message map for the HL7 v2 MDM_T01 structure (T01, original document notification; http://hl7.org/v2/StructureDefinition/MDM_T01), for which hl7.fhir.uv.v2mappings 1.0.0 ships none. The rows are those of ConceptMap/message-mdm-t02-to-bundle for every segment MDM_T01 shares with MDM_T02 at the same group path; MDM_T01 carries no OBSERVATION group, so the rows of its OBX and NTE are left out. CON and PRT stay counted as unmapped. FerroBRIDGE #637.",
